  "summary": "Within the stated arithmetic interpretation, the conditional matches: both inclusion of every F-theorem in K and the existence of a sentence in K outside F’s theorems are conclusions. It thus rules out K = F.theory when K accepts the pointwise scheme under the background hypotheses, without ruling out an algorithm for K unconditionally."
